{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥，结束了？”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3452", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "班会结束后，樱乃像平常那样来到我的教室。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，正好结束了。”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“时机好准。”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3453", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“兄妹……交……真的……传闻……吗？”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "混在喧闹声中，“声音”又出现了。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那是没有意识、注意到的话就听不到的……声音。", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥？”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3454", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……没什么。”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃好像听不到。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过……为什么？", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“濑名同学，谢谢你每天都陪我们。”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一起用功就感觉时间过得特别快。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "表示这段时间非常充实吧。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我是无所谓……”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5594", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁不在很寂寞？”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3455", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是啊。她其实也不是脑袋不好，教起来有成就感。”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5595", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘿……那如果一直被濑名同学教学，她就能进步到很棒的分数吧？”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是啊。不过安洁的目的是为了寻找自己服侍的主人。”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5596", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“定下目标的人很厉害呢。”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是啊。像我就只是漫无目的的念书而已。”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5597b", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样还能考出那么好的成绩也很厉害啊……”", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学用苦笑回应我的话。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为不满足于现状，所以才会前进吧。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃呢？”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5597", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我的目的？”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3456", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对，没有听你说过呢。”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5598", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟葛格在一起。”", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3457", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……抱歉，我不该问的。”", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5599", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“葛格呢？”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3458", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我？我也是跟樱乃在一起喔。”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为了这个目标，我要尽可能努力才行。”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，所以现在是用功准备考试。”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3459", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5600", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学看着我们。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“濑名同学，有什么想问的吗？”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有。你们两人，真的只有用功而已呢。”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5601", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“现在是考试期间喔？”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3460", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是那样没错，但我以为……”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5602", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学脸红了。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“会是更……甜蜜的气氛。”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5603", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟葛格在一起，每天都甜甜蜜蜜。但是，这就跟以前一样。”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3461", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟以前一样……啊，嗯，也是呢。交往就是那样吧。”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5604", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃，不要随口乱说。”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？不是吗？”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5605", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为我们在一起的时间很长了。所以比起恋人，兄妹的感觉更强一点喔。”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然我在等进入亲亲热热状态的机会，但是迟迟没有到来。”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3462", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我都不知道你在等那种事啊。”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那么为了不要妨碍机会出现，我差不多该回去了呢。”", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5606", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“晚饭呢？不一起吃吗？”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3463", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今天久米超市好像有时间限定的促销。”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5607", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“忘记了。”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3464", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样啊。”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“报纸里有夹传单，爱理说的对，有时间限定的促销。”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3465", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这是报纸里夹的传单。”", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3466", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我没有订报纸。居然有一人限购一个的商品！”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5608", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学瞥了我一眼。", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你愿意的话，一起去吧？”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃，可以吗？”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5609", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当然。”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3467", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢你们，太好了。”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5610", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为买到了所有预定要买的东西，濑名同学一脸满足的表情。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这种小事，随时都可以。”", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。果然跟爱理一起购物时，活力不一样。”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3468", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是、是那样吗？”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5611", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好像奔驰在战场的狼，或者锁定猎物的鹰一样。”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3469", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这种程度很普通吧，普通。”", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5612", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……是啊。”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还是不要多说什么好了。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生君，如果有话想说，就清楚地说出来比较好喔？”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5613", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个……”", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔，你们三人来买东西啊？”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 334, "voice": "ht1159", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸，隼太。”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“陪爱理来促销。”", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3470", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘿，这样啊。”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 334, "voice": "ht1160", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对，就是这样。”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5614", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“隼太呢？”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为酱油没有了，所以就被派来跑腿。”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 334, "voice": "ht1161", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“原来如此。”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说，你们用功到这个时间吗？”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 334, "voice": "ht1162", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对。”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3471", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真厉害啊。我也来加油一下不要输给你们。”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 334, "voice": "ht1163", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“考试明天就结束了吧？”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是没错啦。”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 334, "voice": "ht1164", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他苦笑耸了耸肩。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，不好意思跟你聊这么久。”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“也对，老妈会念我的。”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 334, "voice": "ht1165", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那明天见啦。”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“明天见，濑名同学和小樱乃也是。”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 334, "voice": "ht1166", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“明天见。”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 329, "voice": "ar5615", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“现在的话，或许还来得及促销。”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 322, "voice": "sk3472", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈哈，这样啊，我会努力看看。”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 334, "voice": "ht1167", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太朝我们挥手正要离去，不过突然停下了脚步。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，对了新吾。”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 334, "voice": "ht1168", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么？”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“或许是说想太多了……”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 334, "voice": "ht1169", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“暂时不要在学校里跟小樱乃两人独处比较好喔。”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 334, "voice": "ht1170", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
